 "name_en": "Guided Buying Capability with SAP Ariba Buying (2NV)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Guided Buying Capability with SAP Ariba Buying (2NV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The guided buying capability creates a simple, smart, and elegant purchasing experience that increases user engagement across all spend areas. Guided buying serves as a central place where all buyers can shop across all goods and services. It enables procurement and individual line-of-business owners to specify procurement policies and inform and guide users whenever there appear to be policy conflicts. These capabilities enable purchasers to collaborate directly with suppliers and other procurement users in the context of the procurement need, making procurement more efficient.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Users find items across catalogs, including partial items, forms, and suppliers in a single search box. All spend contracted through supplier-provided catalogs and punch-out catalogs is available for the user to search. Using online shopping as an example, users can filter items by price or manufacturer.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Access customized guided buying app and searches for items across catalogs, including partial items, forms, and suppliers in a single search box</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get policy guidance as items are added to the requisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform budget checks in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> before submitting the requisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve decisions as per the configured workflow</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate approved requisition into <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> as purchase requisitions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase orders automatically from those requisitions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive and account for items in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> with Goods Receipt app</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive and post supplier invoice in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update the SAP Ariba requisitions with follow-on document record IDs for traceability</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase employee performance with simple guided user experience</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Apply procurement policies automatically through the guided process, enforcing compliance during the purchasing process, not after</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use flexible configuration to allow line-of-business-specific definition of forms, permissions, and system behavior at field level and for workflows, so each persona in the process only enters their respective data, avoiding clerical errors and streamlining purchasing for each LoB</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Ariba Buying 的引导式采购功能 (2NV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">引导式采购功能可以创建简单、智能且卓越的采购体验，从而提高所有支出领域的用户参与度。引导式采购用作所有采购商可以购买所有商品和服务的中心位置。它使采购和各个业务范围所有者能够指定采购政策，并在出现政策冲突时通知并指导用户。这些功能使采购员能够在采购需求的上下文中直接与供应商和其他采购用户协作，从而提高采购效率。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">用户在单个搜索框中查找目录中的项目，包括部分项目、表单和供应商。通过供应商提供的目录和 PunchOut 目录签订合同的所有支出都可供用户搜索。以在线购物为例，用户可以按价格或制造商筛选项目。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">访问自定义的引导式采购应用，并在单个搜索框中搜索目录中的项目，包括部分项目、表单和供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将项目添加到申请中时，获取政策指导</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在提交请购单之前，在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 中执行预算检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据配置的工作流审批决策</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将已批准的申请复制到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 作为采购申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从这些请购单中自动创建订购单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用“收货”应用接收并说明 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 中的项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 中接收和过账供应商发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用后续文档记录标识符更新 SAP Ariba 请购单以实现可追溯性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc982d406ca93491b96f4a95c35e5019c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过简单的引导式用户体验提高员工绩效</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过引导式流程自动应用采购政策，增强采购流程中的合规性，而不是在采购流程之后</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用灵活的配置允许在字段级别和工作流中对表单、权限和系统行为进行业务范围特定的定义，因此流程中的每个人员仅输入各自的数据，从而避免文书错误并简化每个业务线的采购</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
